    "reviews": "\u201cI\u2019m confident that if you like the challenge that roguelikes offer then you\u2019ll find Crown Trick to tick all of your boxes.\u201d<br>90/100 \u2013 The Indie Game Website<br><br>\u201cthere are plenty of ways for the player to take on the challenge. It\u2019s this design that makes Crown Trick a must-play for both dungeon-crawler and roguelike fans.\u201d<br>90/100 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cIt's rogue-lite goodness wrapped in a challenging, engaging, and highly enjoyable package.\u201d<br>85/100 \u2013 PC Invasion<br>",
